OL,3,GNEWSAViolent disorder charge over
OL,4,Amarina migrant protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with violent
OL,7,Fdisorder following an anti-migrant
OL,8,Fdemonstration in Portsmouth.
OL,10,FProtesters gathered at Eastney Marina
OL,11,Fon 6 September where 120 migrants, who
OL,12,Fhad crossed the Channel in a dinghy,
OL,13,Fwere being transported out of the city
OL,14,Fon coaches.
OL,16,FHampshire Police said Justin Dixon, 50,
OL,17,Ffrom Havant, had been charged with
OL,18,Fviolent disorder as part of an
OL,19,Finvestigation into alleged offences at
OL,20,Fthe protest.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
